{"id":"637329","name":"牛肉拌粉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637329/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干米粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"200克"},{"name":"青红辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好干米粉。","img":"images/637329/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"起锅烧水。","img":"images/637329/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"水开后，下入米粉。","img":"images/637329/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮熟，大概5分钟左右，再盖上锅盖，焖20分钟，至熟透。","img":"images/637329/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"过凉水，清洗干净浮沫，待用。","img":"images/637329/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"准备好牛肉。","img":"images/637329/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/637329/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加油再次抓匀，锁住水分。","img":"images/637329/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"起锅烧热，加油。","img":"images/637329/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入牛肉快速翻炒。","img":"images/637329/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻炒变色。","img":"images/637329/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盛出。","img":"images/637329/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中留油，下入辣椒和大蒜头翻炒断生。","img":"images/637329/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入牛肉。","img":"images/637329/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"加盐，鸡精，蚝油、生抽、老抽，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/637329/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"盛出待用。","img":"images/637329/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"煮好的米粉放入大碗中。","img":"images/637329/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"倒入炒好的牛肉，加盐、鸡精、老抽、香油。","img":"images/637329/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/637329/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"加入香油和葱花，拌匀即可食用。","img":"images/637329/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/637329/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"尝尝哦。","img":"images/637329/step_22.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：